#: admin/partials/plugnmeet-admin-edit-room.php
msgid "Join the audio by phone call."
msgstr "通过电话加入音频。"

#: admin/partials/plugnmeet-admin-edit-room.php
msgid "Encrypt media streams between participants."
msgstr "加密参与者之间的媒体流。"

#: admin/partials/plugnmeet-admin-edit-room.php
msgid "Transcription, chat translation and AI tools."
msgstr "转录、聊天翻译和AI工具。"

#: admin/partials/plugnmeet-admin-edit-room.php
msgid "What participants can do when they join."
msgstr "参与者加入后可以做什么。"

#: admin/partials/plugnmeet-admin-edit-room.php
msgid "Colors, logo and background."
msgstr "颜色、标志和背景。"

#: admin/partials/plugnmeet-admin-edit-room.php
msgid "Room access per WordPress role."
msgstr "按WordPress角色访问房间。"

#: admin/partials/plugnmeet-admin-edit-room.php
msgid "Expand all"
msgstr "全部展开"

#: admin/partials/plugnmeet-admin-edit-room.php
msgid "Collapse all"
msgstr "全部崩溃"

#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php
msgid "The base URL of your PlugNmeet server (e.g., https://pnm.example.com)."
msgstr "你 PlugNmeet 服务器的基础网址（例如 https://pnm.example.com）。"

#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php
msgid "The unique API key provided by your PlugNmeet server."
msgstr "你的PlugMeet服务器提供的独特API密钥。"

#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php
msgid "The API secret provided by your PlugNmeet server used for secure authentication."
msgstr "你的 PlugNmeet 服务器提供的 API 秘密用于安全认证。"

#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php
msgid "Choose how the meeting client is delivered. Remote (default): the meeting opens on a standalone page served by this plugin, with the client files loaded from your plugNmeet server. Local: the client files are served from this plugin — use the Update button to download them first; useful for serving your own customized client. Redirect: users are taken directly to your plugNmeet server's interface and leave your site."
msgstr "选择会议客户端的交付方式。远程（默认）：会议在由该插件服务的独立页面上开启，客户端文件从你的 plugNmeet 服务器加载。本地：客户端文件由该插件提供——使用更新按钮先下载;对服务自定义客户端非常有用。重定向：用户直接进入 plugNmeet 服务器的界面，离开你的站点。"

#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php
msgid "Advanced option for using your own customized plugNmeet client. The Update button downloads the client zip from this URL to your server. Only used when client load is set to Local."
msgstr "使用你自定义的 plugNmeet 客户端的高级选项。更新按钮将客户端从该 URL 下载到 服务器的压缩包。仅在客户端加载设置为本地时使用。"

#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php
msgid "Optimizes performance by dynamically pausing video layers that are not being viewed by participants. This significantly reduces server-side CPU and bandwidth usage. <strong>Note:</strong> This will be automatically enabled if using SVC codecs (VP9/AV1) and is required for multi-codec simulcast."
msgstr "通过动态暂停未被参与者观看的视频层来优化性能。这显著降低了服务器端的CPU和带宽使用。 <strong>注：</strong> 如果使用SVC编解码器（VP9/AV1），该功能将自动启用，且多编解码器同步播出时是必需的。"

#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php
msgid "Delivers multiple video quality layers to ensure a smooth experience for users on weak connections."
msgstr "提供多层视频质量，确保连接较弱的用户体验流畅。"

#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php
msgid "The encoding standard for video transmission. VP8 is the default and offers the widest browser compatibility. VP9 offers a superior balance of video quality, CPU efficiency and low latency, and automatically falls back to VP8 on older browsers. <strong>Warning:</strong> Advanced codecs like AV1 require modern browser support; ensure your users are on compatible setups if you deviate from the default."
msgstr "视频传输的编码标准。VP8是默认格式，提供最广泛的浏览器兼容性。VP9在视频质量、CPU效率和低延迟之间实现了更优的平衡，并在旧浏览器上自动回退到VP8。 <strong>警告：</strong> 像AV1这样的高级编解码器需要现代浏览器支持;如果你偏离默认设置，请确保用户使用兼容的设置。"

#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php
msgid "The initial resolution setting for participant cameras."
msgstr "参与式摄像头的初始分辨率设置。"

#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php
msgid "The initial resolution setting for screen sharing."
msgstr "屏幕共享的初始分辨率设置。"

#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php
msgid "The audio quality profile optimized for the session."
msgstr "音频质量配置文件为会话优化。"

#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php
msgid "When enabled, the microphone track is fully stopped while muted instead of just being silenced, so no audio data is sent while muted."
msgstr "启用时，麦克风轨道在静音时完全停止，而不是静音，所以静音时不会发送音频数据。"

#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php
msgid "Display the copyright text in the client footer."
msgstr "在客户端页脚显示版权文本。"

#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php
msgid "Branding text displayed in the client footer. HTML is supported for links or custom styling."
msgstr "品牌文字显示在客户端页脚中。支持HTML用于链接或自定义样式。"

#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php
msgid "The page a room link opens on. By default the room opens inside your theme's normal layout; for a clean, distraction-free meeting view, create an empty page (Pages > Add New) and select it here. After changing, go to Settings > Permalinks and simply click \"Save Changes\"."
msgstr "房间链接打开的页面。默认情况下，房间会在你主题的正常布局中打开;为了获得干净、无干扰的会议视图，创建一个空白页面（页面>添加新页面），并在这里选择。更改后，进入设置>永久链接，点击“保存更改”即可。"

#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php
msgid "The first part of every room link. The default plugnmeet/room gives links like yoursite.com/plugnmeet/room/room-id; you can change it to any word you prefer, e.g. meetings. After changing it, go to Settings > Permalinks and simply click \"Save Changes\"."
msgstr "每个房间链接的第一部分。默认的 plugnmeet/room 会提供像 yoursite.com/plugnmeet/room/room-id;你可以改成任何你喜欢的词，比如会议。更改后，进入设置>永久链接，点击“保存更改”。"

#: admin/class-plugnmeet-room-page.php
msgid "Connection details for your plugNmeet server and client delivery."
msgstr "关于你的 plugNmeet 服务器和客户端交付的连接详情。"

#: admin/class-plugnmeet-room-page.php
msgid "Default technical configurations applied to every new session."
msgstr "默认的技术配置应用到每个新会话。"

#: admin/class-plugnmeet-room-page.php
msgid "Global defaults for the meeting client. Rooms can override the design and logo from their Design tab; copyright is always global."
msgstr "会议客户端的全局默认值。会议室可以通过设计标签覆盖设计和标志;版权始终是全局的。"

#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php
msgid "Choose how the room page (login form and recordings) looks. Theme default (no plugin CSS): your theme's own styling, which is how the room page works today. Clean: a minimal, light design with an inline login form (name, password and Join button in one line). Modern: a bolder design using your primary color. The color fields below apply to the selected design."
msgstr "选择房间页面（登录表单和录制）的样式。主题默认（无插件CSS）：你主题自己的样式，这也是房间页面目前的运作方式。干净：简洁轻盈的设计，内联登录表单（名字、密码和加入按钮一行）。现代：使用你的主色，采用更大胆的设计。下面的颜色字段适用于所选设计。"

#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php
msgid "The main color of the selected frontend design: the Join button, accents and focus rings on the room page. Leave blank to use the design's default."
msgstr "所选前端设计的主色：房间页面上的“加入”按钮、强调和焦点环。保留空白以使用设计默认颜色。"

#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php
msgid "The secondary color of the selected frontend design: soft backgrounds and the recordings table header. Leave blank to use the design's default."
msgstr "所选前端设计的次要颜色：柔和背景和录制表头。保留空格以使用设计默认。"

